            "id": 59686,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Tampilkan nilai string di console.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" ingredients = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Sugar, spice, and everything nice&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(ingredients);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"57\" endIndex=\"68\" /><option startIndex=\"68\" endIndex=\"69\" /><option startIndex=\"69\" endIndex=\"80\" /><option startIndex=\"80\" endIndex=\"81\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"display\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Sugar, spice, and everything nice\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>console.log</code>, diikuti oleh <code>(</code>, lalu <code>ingredients</code>, <code>)</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Tampilkan daftar bahan yang tersimpan, bukan nama variabel sebagai teks.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" ingredients = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Sugar, spice, and everything nice&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(ingredients);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"57\" endIndex=\"68\" /><option startIndex=\"68\" endIndex=\"69\" /><option startIndex=\"69\" endIndex=\"80\" /><option startIndex=\"80\" endIndex=\"81\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"display\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"console\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;ingredients&quot;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Sugar, spice, and everything nice\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>console.log</code>, diikuti oleh <code>(</code>, <code>ingredients</code>, dan terakhir <code>)</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question 1",
            "id": 59764,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Apa yang ditampilkan kode ini di konsol?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" income = \" /><text value=\"1400\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" savings = \" /><text value=\"900\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"savings = \" /><text value=\"1000\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"income = \" /><text value=\"1500\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(savings);\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"1000\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>1000</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>1500</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>900</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>1000</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Mengapa <code>console.log(savings)</code> terakhir menampilkan nilai tersebut?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" income = \" /><text value=\"1400\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" savings = \" /><text value=\"900\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"savings = \" /><text value=\"1000\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"income = \" /><text value=\"1500\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(savings);\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"1000\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Menampilkan <code>1000</code> karena nilai tersebut menggantikan <code>900</code> dalam <code>savings</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Menampilkan <code>1500</code> karena itu nilai terakhir yang ditetapkan di mana pun</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Menampilkan <code>900</code> karena variabel mempertahankan nilai pertamanya</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Menampilkan <code>1000</code> karena nilai tersebut menggantikan <code>900</code> dalam <code>savings</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example 5",
            "id": 59768,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Tampilkan <code>goal</code> dikurangi <code>milesRan</code> di console.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" goal = \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" milesRan = \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Miles left: &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(goal - milesRan);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"78\" endIndex=\"82\" /><option startIndex=\"83\" endIndex=\"84\" /><option startIndex=\"85\" endIndex=\"93\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"/\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Miles left: \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"2\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>goal</code>, diikuti oleh <code>-</code>, dan terakhir <code>milesRan</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Setelah label, tampilkan berapa mil yang tersisa dari <code>goal</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" goal = \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" milesRan = \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Miles left: &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(goal - milesRan);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"78\" endIndex=\"82\" /><option startIndex=\"83\" endIndex=\"84\" /><option startIndex=\"85\" endIndex=\"93\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"+\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"*\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"/\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Miles left: \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"2\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>goal</code>, diikuti oleh <code>-</code>, dan terakhir <code>milesRan</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
